{"id":88940274778845,"name":"[HUGE UPDATE] Martial Grounds","desc":"Martial Grounds is a unique fighting game inspired by \"Absolver\".\nThe game offers a bunch of fighting styles each have their own unique Style Ability and passive.\nThe main part of the game is Deck Building, think of it as making your own moveset with over 200+ punches and kicks to choose from.\nGear up, Survive, fight, or just... hangout\neverything you see here may not be final\n\n\"Step into a rowdy frontier town where every brawl holds a tale.\"\n\nControls: \nM1 = Punch\nE = Kick\nM2 / Left CTRL = Alternate Toggle (For Attacks & Special Abilities)\nF = Block\nH = Emotes\nR = Style Ability (directional)/Getup mechanic\nAlternate Toggle (M2/CTRL)+Q = Burst\nM = Menu\nYou can change your voicelines in settings\n\nChat commands:\n/party -- DISABLED ATM\n- puts an interactable on you and to get in a party your friend must interact with it\n\nJoin the community server for more information.\n\ntags(ignore): fighting, martial, battlegrounds, melee, fists, wrestling, boxing, blood, hangout, customization, creative","path":"/game/88940274778845-huge-update-martial-grounds","slug":"88940274778845-huge-update-martial-grounds","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b5f8a2edaf1cdaf359c60bf93b319d0e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-38c029fdaeb6c5cfad1311cefd71c2a3/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":3,"visitor":612846,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-15T15:06:39.362Z","creator":{"name":"The Martial Grounds","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"HUGE-UPDATE-Martial-Grounds-inf-hp-and-instane-kill-player-and-more-243300","_id":"6a57a1ff9cfc6a13f5facd32","title":"inf hp and instane kill player and more","game":{"_id":"6a57a1ff9cfc6a13f5facd31","gameId":88940274778845,"name":"[HUGE UPDATE] Martial Grounds","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-38c029fdaeb6c5cfad1311c